# Graphify extraction excludes — ParkEase (ADR-028)
#
# This file is authoritative when graphify runs with --no-gitignore, which is how
# ParkEase builds its graph: docs/, CLAUDE.md and learnings.md are .gitignore'd here
# (they are kept local), but they are the governance chain and the single most
# valuable thing in the graph. So .gitignore is bypassed and THIS file carries the
# exclusions instead.
#
# Rule: secrets never enter the graph. graph.json is plain text on disk and the
# semantic pass can send file content to a model backend. R-ENV-05.

# Secrets — never extract, never infer, never embed
.env
.env.*
!.env.example
*.pem
*.key
*.keystore
*.jks
google-services.json
**/secrets/

# Dependencies and stores
node_modules/
.pnpm-store/
.venv/
__pycache__/

# Build output
dist/
build/
.next/
.turbo/
.expo/
coverage/
*.tsbuildinfo
apps/mobile/android/
apps/mobile/ios/

# VCS and tooling internals
.git/
graphify-out/

# Lockfiles — huge, no architectural signal
pnpm-lock.yaml
package-lock.json
yarn.lock
